Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Database Connection Failures
If you encounter database connection issues:

# Check if PostgreSQL container is running
docker ps | grep postgres-db

# Check PostgreSQL logs
docker logs postgres-db

# Test direct connection
PGPASSWORD=vaultpassword psql -h localhost -U vault -d testdb -c "SELECT 1;"

# Restart PostgreSQL if needed
docker restart postgres-db
Issue 2: Vault Seal Status
If Vault becomes sealed:

# Check Vault status
vault status

# Unseal if needed
vault operator unseal $UNSEAL_KEY
Issue 3: Permission Denied Errors
If you get permission errors:

# Check if vault user has proper permissions
docker exec -it postgres-db psql -U postgres -d testdb -c "SELECT rolname, rolcreaterole, rolcreatedb FROM pg_roles WHERE rolname = 'vault';"

# Re-grant permissions if needed
docker exec -it postgres-db psql -U postgres -d testdb -c "ALTER USER vault CREATEDB; ALTER USER vault CREATEROLE;"
